# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:14
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_5c07169a:

    # "Peering into the depths of the stagnant water over the edges of the erected stone pathways gave me an uneasy feeling."
    "築かれた石道の縁から、澱んだ水の奥を覗き込むと、不穏な気分になった。"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:15
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_75e29588:

    # "I could not see what was down there, but I could sense movement beneath that blackened water all the same."
    "下には何があるのか見えなかったが、それでも黒ずんだ水の底で、かすかに動く気配を感じ取ることができた。"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:16
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_16c00e6b:

    # "Just how deep did these waters run?"
    "一体どれほど深く、この水は流れていたか。"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:19
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_af42c0e5:

    # "Placing my hand into the water, the ripples once again waved across the still waters."
    "静かな水面に手を差し伸べると、さざ波が再び広がっていった。"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:23
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_fc27693d:

    # "This time though, bursting out of the waters came a fury of tentacles thrashing wildly!"
    "今度は、水からほとばしり出たのは、狂ったように打ち振るう触手の怒濤だった!"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:24
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_a70c5cab:

    # MC "(FUCK!)"
    MC "(ちくしょう!)"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:26
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_25516f50:

    # "I transformed, preparing myself for battle."
    "変身した、戦いに備えて。"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:33
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_4f11fb8d:

    # "After slashing and tearing off one of the beasts' tentacles that dropped down into the waters, the beast howled in rage as it quickly retreated and submerged itself back into the black depths from where it came."
    "獣の触手の一本を切り裂き引きちぎり、水面へと落とすや、その獣は怒りの咆哮を上げて速やかに退却し、暗き闇の奥底へとその身を沈めていった。"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:36
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_ee79b738:

    # MC "{i}...How the hell does that thing even live down here?{/i}"
    MC "{i}…いったい全体、あの生物はどうやってここで暮らしているんだ？{/i}"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:37
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_4e2751cc:

    # "I noticed on the floor, some strange shimmering gem that wasn't there before."
    "床に、前にはなかった奇妙にきらめく宝石が落ちているのに気がついた。"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:40
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_80e8c4f0:

    # MC "(Huh? What is this thing?)"
    MC "(え？ これ何？)"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:44
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_7770dba9:

    # "Deciding it was probably not a good idea to continue messing with the water, I stepped back."
    "水をいじり続けるのは良くないと思って、私は一歩下がった。"

# game/data/world_interactions/demorai_temple_kraken.rpy:45
translate ja world_clickable_temple_kraken_24488d99:

    # MC "(Whatever's in there isn't going to appreciate me splashing around.)"
    MC "(中にいるやつが、水音を立てられて気に入らないだろうな。)"

